  "content": [
    {
      "value": "<blockquote><p>Moon low and whole over the outer islands: the water comes back at a run.</p><p>Moon thin and high: walk out, and walk back at the same speed you went.</p><p>Moon not to be seen: do not pass the fourth line, whatever is stranded past it.</p><p>Fog on the flat and no wind: the moon is where it was yesterday, and so are you.</p></blockquote>",
      "inLanguage": [{ "id": ["core.peerdb.org", "LANGUAGE", "en-GB"] }]
    }
